=== 2. R7a  tools/verify/test-inventory.cjs ====================================
Contract: run the project-locked jest with --json, then FAIL unless
 (1) every test/smoke/*.test.ts on disk appears in testResults,
 (2) the on-disk suite set equals docs/test-inventory.json,
 (3) every manifest test title is present and no undeclared title appeared,
 (4) every reported test status is "passed" (catches only/skip/todo/pending),
 (5) the jest run succeeded.
Extra jest args may be appended after "--" so the gate itself can be negative-
controlled (and so an exclusion cannot hide behind the gate).

CONTROL (work copy, pristine): --update wrote the manifest ->
  {"ok":true,"totals":{"suites":29,"tests":207,"passed":207,"failed":0}}  EXIT 0
  check mode: ok true, 29/207/207, failures []                            EXIT 0

