OBS-4 tools/verify/v06-report.cjs now asserts every recorded revision (dual
  source.baseRevision, catalog source.baseRevision, recipe batch baseRevision and
  all 30 run.revision values, de-duplicated) is a commit reachable from HEAD; the
  message is emitted as a blocker and a revision block is written into
  docs/evidence/v06-review-gate.json + docs/v06-final-gate.md.
