      against it): status PASS, blockers [], revision.failures []  EXIT 0
    INJECTED dual.source.baseRevision -> deadbeef... (40 hex, unreachable)
      -> EXIT 1, status BLOCKED, blocker "证据 revision 无法归因到本仓库历史：
         Golden dual-track evidence revision deadbeef... is not a commit reachable
         from HEAD bb80ea..."   DETECTED; restore verified 4e185b084c98cf74, then
      CONTROL again EXIT 0 status PASS.
    POSITIVE branch against real history (read-only, no writes to the repo):
      revisionInHistory(c2e71bbe236e18cd7f4ba475d0bb3896de7e31dd) = true   (dual)
      revisionInHistory(3a53957db6bdd009bbd85af8b7d589a0b48dba5b) = true   (catalog)
      revisionInHistory(30e97e3a35630dfc316af6910418d5994bcb2ba8) = true   (recipes)
      revisionInHistory(deadbeef...) = false; HEAD-is-ancestor-of-itself = true
